    "Books" : {},
    "Books already imported stay in your library." : {},
    "Bookscroll imports each new EPUB, PDF, text, Markdown, HTML or RTF file in the folder and its subfolders when you open the app. A file is imported once. Removing a file from the folder does not delete the book, and a book you delete is not imported again. Books already in your library are skipped." : {},
    "Bookscroll is not ready yet. Try again." : {},
    "Bookscroll keeps the text of each book, not the original file. The search index is not in device backups." : {},
    "Bookscroll works fully offline. It has no account, no analytics and makes no network calls." : {},
    "Brightness" : {},
    "Brightness moves the theme from its darkest to its lightest shade. Each theme keeps its own brightness. Text, accent and highlight colours change with it so that they stay readable." : {},
